\ tests/native/kernel-memop.4 - a VARIABLE's fetch folded into the
\ operation after it (Iteration 662): + - AND OR XOR with [X] as operand,
\ = < > U< <> comparing with it - as a flag, and fused with IF WHILE UNTIL
\ - and >R pushing it from memory; a jump's target between the fetch and
\ the operation, where nothing may fold; the depth after each line.
\ Native, CV8-asm and CV8-C print the same.
VARIABLE X   VARIABLE Y
1 63 LSHIFT CONSTANT MIN-N   MIN-N 1- CONSTANT MAX-N
CREATE VALS  MIN-N , -2 , -1 , 0 , 1 , 2 , MAX-N ,
: V ( i --- x )  CELLS VALS + @ ;
: A+ X @ + ;   : A- X @ - ;   : AAND X @ AND ;   : AOR X @ OR ;   : AXOR X @ XOR ;
: F= X @ = ;   : F< X @ < ;   : F> X @ > ;   : FU< X @ U< ;   : F<> X @ <> ;
: B< ( a --- )  X @ < IF ." T" ELSE ." F" THEN ;
: BU< ( a --- )  X @ U< IF ." T" ELSE ." F" THEN ;
: B= ( a --- )  X @ = IF ." T" ELSE ." F" THEN ;
: ARITH ( --- )  7 0 DO I V X !  7 0 DO
    I V A+ .  I V A- .  I V AAND .  I V AOR .  I V AXOR .  LOOP CR LOOP ;
ARITH DEPTH . CR
: FLAGS ( --- )  7 0 DO I V X !  7 0 DO
    I V F= .  I V F< .  I V F> .  I V FU< .  I V F<> .  LOOP CR LOOP ;
FLAGS DEPTH . CR
: BRS ( --- )  7 0 DO I V X !  7 0 DO  I V B<  I V BU<  I V B=  LOOP CR LOOP ;
BRS DEPTH . CR
: CNT ( n --- c )  X !  0 BEGIN DUP X @ < WHILE 1+ REPEAT ;
: CNTU ( n --- c )  X !  0 BEGIN 1+ DUP X @ = UNTIL ;
5 CNT .  0 CNT .  -3 CNT .  6 CNTU .  DEPTH . CR
: RT ( a --- a+x*2 )  X @ >R  R@ +  R> + ;
7 X !  1 RT .  -100 RT .  DEPTH . CR
: G3 ( a b f --- n )  IF DROP X @ THEN + ;
10 X !  1 2 -1 G3 .  1 2 0 G3 .  DEPTH . CR
: TWO ( --- n )  X @ Y @ +  X @ Y @ -  * ;
3 X !  5 Y !  TWO .  -4 X !  9 Y !  TWO .  DEPTH . CR
: MAXX ( a --- m )  DUP X @ < IF DROP X @ THEN ;
: USE ( --- )  4 X !  1 MAXX .  9 MAXX .  ['] MAXX 2 SWAP EXECUTE . ;
USE  DEPTH . CR
.( end) CR   \ the last line: verify's native_cmp wants it (656)
BYE
